## 6. Profiles (draft)

These are first drafts to refine, not researched facts. Each profile has a checklist, slice template and verification recipe.

### 6.1 `browser-game-2d`
- **Evidence:** deps `phaser`, `pixi.js`, `kaplay`/`kaboom`, `littlejsengine`; `canvas` usage; `requestAnimationFrame`; sprite/tilemap/audio assets; `index.html` with canvas.
- **Completeness checklist:** input handler (keyboard, pointer, gamepad), game loop (fixed timestep), scene/state management, asset loader with progress, audio with user-gesture unlock, save/load, build/export path, pause/resume, basic tests for pure logic, README with controls.
- **Vertical slice:** input > update > render > asset > save.
- **Verification recipe:** (static) parse all JS/TS, check asset paths referenced exist. (Future backend) start build, load in headless browser, assert no console errors, canvas present.
- **Registry categories:** input handling, audio, physics, save/load, asset loading, UI/menus, build/bundling, testing.

### 6.2 `web-page`
- **Evidence:** `index.html`, CSS, optional SPA framework (`react`, `vue`, `svelte`, `preact`, `solid-js`), no server code.
- **Checklist:** `<title>` and meta, viewport, favicon, accessible landmarks, responsive CSS, manifest/service worker if PWA, build tooling, lint, tests, deploy config, README.
- **Slice:** route/page > component > state > data fetch > test.
- **Verification (future):** load in headless browser, no console errors, no failed requests.
- **Registry:** not yet researched.

### 6.3 `api-service`
- **Evidence:** deps `express`, `fastify`, `hono`, `nestjs`, `fastapi`, `flask`, `django`; route definitions; Dockerfile.
- **Checklist:** routes, input validation, auth, logging, error handling, data layer and migrations, health endpoint, tests, `.env.example`, OpenAPI docs, CI.
- **Slice:** route > handler > service > DB > test.
- **Verification (future):** start the service, hit the health endpoint.
- **Registry:** not yet researched.

